<title>UK: CLT UFA sets 2.5 billion Luxfr December 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>CLT UFA sets 2.5 billion Luxfr December 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Internationale a Luxembourg, Credit Europeen, Banque Bruxelles Lambert and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLT UFA GROUP AUDOFINA BERTELSMANN</p>
<p> AMT    2.5 BLN FLUX  COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    27.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.5     PAY DATE   L27.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> YIELD	4.58 PCT  DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
